    [X] growl FX name on encoder press for FX tracks

## top right quadrant

[X] fx pads should be enabled only when applicable
    [X] group selected (TwisterSendTracksToFxCtl)
    [X] track in group selected (TwisterSendTrackToAllFxCtl)
    [X] fxctl should be inactive when user selects a device
        [X] this should make space in the top right quadrant for device pad
            controls, especially for custom device mappers, like for frequalizer

